stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Active: start
  Active --> Waiting: user, agent or timer step
  Waiting --> Active: complete or fire
  Active --> Incident: step failed, retries exhausted
  Incident --> Active: retry or resolve
  Active --> Completed: end
  Active --> Cancelled: cancel
  Completed --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
